   "fix": "Move both theorems into `ProjValMeasure/Integral.lean` after `integral_diag_eq_inner_integral` / `norm_integral_le`. Keep the `P.ae`-based results (`integral_eq_zero_iff`, `integral_eq_integral_iff`, `integral_congr_ae`, `tendsto_integral_apply_of_dominated_convergence`) in this file.",
   "issue": "`norm_integral_apply_sq` and `integral_apply_eq_zero_iff` (line 71) use only `P.integral`, `P.diag` and `integral_diag_eq_inner_integral`. Placing them in `DominatedConvergence` hides basic integral API behind an unrelated topic, and users who only want the norm identity (e.g. the pending SA-B48) must import `Null` and the convergence material.",
